# Local proprietary inputs and generated render products never belong in git.
#
# The models and renders here are derived from rights-controlled StarCraft II
# assets and are restricted to admin accounts. This repository is public, so
# committing any of it would make it world-downloadable and defeat that gate
# entirely -- and git history would keep it even after a later removal.
#
# Everything below lives in the private R2 buckets instead. Upload it with
# upload_to_r2.py; see docs/cloud/ALERT_MEDIA_R2.md.
/addons/
/models/
/output/
/delivery/
/outputs/
/work/
/*.blend
/*.blend1
/*.m3
/*.m3a
/*.dds
/*.tga
